WEBVTT

00:00:00.036 --> 00:00:04.397
Create a manual reel and choose an empty project.

00:00:04.397 --> 00:00:10.603
Add a video, then choose your footage in Windows Files. The file dialog is outside this app capture.

00:00:10.603 --> 00:00:15.174
The imported source is ready. Open Select to choose the moments for your reel.
